    "margin": 10467862585.933441,
    "reading": "the budget condition is Y0 <= Y0_max.  Every earlier leg compared 1e-2 against 2.45e-4 and concluded the profile was ~40x too poor.  With Newton the weighted defect of the discrete profile is many orders BELOW the budget, so the profile's defect is no longer the binding constraint -- for a < a*.  What binds instead is the three unpriced Z1 items, which is a different and more tractable problem than 'find a better profile'.  CAREFUL: this is the defect of the DISCRETE profile in the ROUTE-A discretization; carrying it into the certificate needs the same object in the theta-collocation basis plus the discretization error, which is exactly the open ledger item 'Z1 core discretization'."
  },
